% Uppercase is lower octave B, = B3, A = A4, b = B5, c` = C6

% Each %%sync tags the measure right after it with its page/row in
% sheets/concerto_in_b_minor.pdf, so the PDF viewer can scroll in step with
% playback. row is the 1-indexed system on that page, counted from the top.
% %%syncpage declares how many systems a page actually has, so row height is
% computed correctly even though only the first 5 of page 1's 10 rows are
% tagged so far (the transcription doesn't go further yet).
